From c15208f2ed73601a628ef2dfafaffb98a6e56a84 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Abhishek <abhishek01789@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 21:52:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 25/41] Show workspaces to KDE's Pager as virtual desktops

- org_kde_plasma_virtual_desktop_management: desktops 1..N of the current
  monitor (N = highest workspace in use or shown), named "Desktop N",
  one row, the active one marked
- A Pager click activates the workspace through workspace.event.onActivate
- Each plasma window enters its workspace's desktop instead of being on
  all desktops; a Pager drag or "move to desktop" moves the window
- A window on another desktop no longer looks minimized to the taskbar
